{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>宏福苑大火一年，朱家說， 76 歲的老父葬身火海，屍骨無存，成了他們一生難癒的傷痛和愧疚。這一年，他們努力生活，自力更生，亦盼望害人者承擔責任，杜絕悲劇——真正需要「大維修」不是屋苑，而是制度、是官僚，是人性的貪婪。</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><p>\n</p></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p>相關報道：<br/><br/><a href=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/%e5%ae%8f%e7%a6%8f%e8%8b%91%e5%a4%a7%e7%81%ab%e4%b8%80%e5%b9%b4%ef%bd%9c%e4%b8%8a%e6%a8%93%e8%a6%8b%e4%ba%a1%e7%88%b6%e9%aa%b8%e9%aa%a8%e8%87%aa%e8%b2%ac%e3%80%80%e9%87%8d%e7%b9%aa%e7%88%b6%e8%a6%aa/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">宏福苑大火一年｜上樓見亡父骸骨自責　重繪父親印記　問責是為了別讓瓦礫尋親的痛再現</a></p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"237\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Payme-500x237.png\" width=\"500\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T13:23:57.919230+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":1,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T02:16:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T15:17:14.976091+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T13:17:17.461254+00:00","content_hash":"e0582f94dedcd1d6e5a722419af7afbe27837c6d60d8604edb2c89a650c69a1f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}